//pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2062128792596836352/i08vWYwj_normal.jpg","author_followers":203,"author_following":491,"author_bio":null,"author_location":"Aarde","author_joined_at":"2013-01-02T22:03:15Z","author_verified":false,"links":[],"media":[],"metrics":{"likes":0,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":0,"views":98}},{"post_id":"2082118206609592574","url":"https://x.com/JOHNGRT/status/2082118206609592574","created_at":"2026-07-28T14:57:18Z","text":"@Vincentgdevlugt Brussel is een jungle. De buitenwijken zijn voor normale toeristen al volledig off limits. Prachtige binnenstad waar het enigszins normaal kan zijn. Kom je daarbuiten dan waan je je ergens in Afrika en daar gelden andere regels. Daar is niets racistisch aan maar gewoon waarheid","original_text":"@Vincentgdevlugt Brussel is een jungle. De buitenwijken zijn voor normale toeristen al volledig off limits. Prachtige binnenstad waar het enigszins normaal kan zijn. Kom je daarbuiten dan waan je je ergens in Afrika en daar gelden andere regels. Daar is niets racistisch aan maar gewoon waarheid","translation_zh":"@Vincentgdevlugt 布鲁塞尔就是一片丛林。那些郊区对普通游客来说已经完全是禁区。市中心很漂亮，在那里还算有点正常。你一走出那里，就会觉得自己像是在非洲某个地方，而那里适用的是另一套规则。这没什么种族主义的，只是事实","translation_status":"translated","author_name":"John","author_handle":"JOHNGRT","author_avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2047793429351149568/ror1q_1O_normal.jpg","author_followers":613,"author_following":1081,"author_bio":null,"author_location":"the Netherlands","author_joined_at":"2011-09-03T17:02:08Z","author_verified":false,"links":[],"media":[],"metrics":{"likes":1,"reposts":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0,"bookmarks":0,"views":110}},{"post_id":"2082128188453404780","url":"https://x.com/Vincentgdevlugt/status/2082128188453404780","created_at":"2026-07-28T15:36:58Z","text":"@Ponylipjes Goede vraag","original_text":"@Ponylipjes Goede vraag","translation_zh":"@Ponylipjes 好问题","translation_status":"translated","author_name":"Vincent G. de Vlugt","author_handle":"Vinc